latin shell, sealed together. The orange half contains the printed marking.\n    - Attribute 6 Quantity - One capsule is present.\n    - Attribute 7 Relative Location - The capsule is positioned horizontally in the center of the frame, with its long axis parallel to the bottom edge.\n    - Attribute 8 Orientation - The capsule is oriented horizontally, lying flat with its ends rounded and facing left and right.\n    - Attribute 9 Connection or Attachments - The two halves of the capsule are connected by a seamless seam along their junction, forming a single, sealed unit. The printed marking is part of the orange half, which is physically connected to the black half."